      "explanation_md": "# RexNet Contrastive Audio XAI Report\n        \nThis report presents an example-based, concept-grounded contrastive explanation of the model's classification of the given audio sample.\n\n---\n\n## Classification Overview\n\n* **Target File**: `icbhi_180_1b4_Al_mc_AKGC417L_5.wav`\n* **True Target Concept**: `Wheeze`\n* **Base CNN Prediction**: `Normal` (Confidence: **99.99%**)\n* **RexNet Contrastive Prediction (Consensus)**: `Normal`\n* **Prediction Correctness**: **INCORRECT**\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Contrast Explanations\n\nTo fully explain this sound, we compared it against representative **contrast/foil concepts** in the `lung_sounds` domain. \nBelow are the detailed side-by-side acoustic cue comparison tables and the model's NNRank ordinal predictions.\n\n\n### Target vs. Contrast Concept: `Crackle`\n\n* **Contrast Exemplar Sound**: `icbhi_211_1p2_Pl_mc_AKGC417L_3.wav`\n* **Contrastive Prediction**: `Normal` (Confidence: **100.00%**)\n* **NNRank Relation Predictor Accuracy**: **5/6 Cues Correct**\n\n#### Side-by-Side Audio Comparison (Full Context)\nListen to the target sample against the representative grounded exemplar of class `Crackle`:\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=\"center\">Target Sound Sample (Normal)</th>\n    <th align=\"center\">Original Foil Exemplar (Crackle)</th>\n    <th align=\"center\">Generated Foil Contrast</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>\n        <source src=\"audio/icbhi_180_target.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\n      </audio>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>\n        <source src=\"audio/icbhi_211_1p2_Pl_mc_AKGC417L_3_class0_exemplar.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\n      </audio>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>\n        <source src=\"audio/icbhi_180_vs_class0_contrast.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\n      </audio>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n#### Acoustic Concept Cue Relation Predictions\nThe model predicts the ordinal relationship of 6 DSP heuristic concepts between the target and foil.\n\n| Concept Cue | Target Value | Foil Value | Heuristic Relation | Model predicted relation | Match |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Loudness / Intensity** | `-12.2291` | `-4.4312` | `Target is LOWER` | `Target is LOWER` | **AGREE** |\n| **Pitch / Brightness (high vs low)** | `629.5273` | `450.8808` | `Target is HIGHER` | `Target is HIGHER` | **AGREE** |\n| **Spectral Width (broad vs narrow/tonal)** | `929.4344` | `776.2966` | `Target is HIGHER` | `Target is HIGHER` | **AGREE** |\n| **High-Frequency Shrillness** | `0.0011` | `0.0037` | `Target is SIMILAR` | `Target is SIMILAR` | **AGREE** |\n| **Crackle Spikiness (popping)** | `3.7531` | `1.6339` | `Target is SIMILAR` | `Target is HIGHER` | **DISAGREE** |\n| **Crackle / Event Density** | `0.2000` | `0.2000` | `Target is SIMILAR` | `Target is SIMILAR` | **AGREE** |\n\n***\n\n### Target vs. Contrast Concept: `Rhonchi`\n\n* **Contrast Exemplar Sound**: `sprsound_66315749_1.4_1_p4_5378_0.wav`\n* **Contrastive Prediction**: `Normal` (Confidence: **100.00%**)\n* **NNRank Relation Predictor Accuracy**: **6/6 Cues Correct**\n\n#### Side-by-Side Audio Comparison (Full Context)\nListen to the target sample against the representative grounded exemplar of class `Rhonchi`:\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=\"center\">Target Sound Sample (Normal)</th>\n    <th align=\"center\">Original Foil Exemplar (Rhonchi)</th>\n    <th align=\"center\">Generated Foil Contrast</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>\n        <source src=\"audio/icbhi_180_target.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\n      </audio>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <audio controls>\n        <source src=\"audio/sprs